========================== Q6 ==============================

Which lambda is valid?

interface A {
    void test(int x);
}

A.
A a = (int x) -> System.out.println(x);

B.
A a = (x) -> System.out.println(x);

C.
A a = x -> System.out.println(x);

D.
All of the above

ANSWER:
D — All of the above

Explicit parameter type, parentheses, and no parentheses
are all allowed for a single parameter.


